  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: rgb(243, 242, 230); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 67, 49); font-family: Georgia, &quot;Songti SC&quot;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0px 24px 26px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word;\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #334331; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"background-image: url(&quot;data:image/png;base64,&quot;); background-position: right top; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 140px 100px; border: 1px solid rgb(103, 114, 91); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 44px 22px 28px; width: 100%;\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"background: transparent; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 67, 49); display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0px 0px 24px; max-width: 100%; padding: 0px; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p><p style=\"background-color: #f3f2e6; border: 1px solid #67725b; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 9px; text-align: left; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p></section><p style=\"color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #4e6a3c; color: #4e6a3c; display: block; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\" data-no-dark=\"\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><p style=\"color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"background-color: #e1e5cf; border: 1px solid #67725b; color: #334331; font-size: 18px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 22px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\" data-no-dark=\"\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\" data-no-dark=\"\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #4e6a3c; color: #4e6a3c; display: block; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\" data-no-dark=\"\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\" data-no-dark=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"background-color: #f3f2e6; border: 1px solid #67725b; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; padding: 9px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><p style=\"background-color: #f3f2e6; border: 1px solid #67725b; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; padding: 9px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><thead data-no-dark=\"\"><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><th style=\"background-color: #4e6a3c; border: 1px solid #67725b; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #4e6a3c; border: 1px solid #67725b; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody data-no-dark=\"\"><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #67725b; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #67725b; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #67725b; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #67725b; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #67725b; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #67725b; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"background-color: #f3f2e6; border: 1px solid #67725b; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; padding: 9px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p></section><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #4e6a3c; color: #4e6a3c; display: block; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\" data-no-dark=\"\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><p style=\"color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\" data-no-dark=\"\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"background-color: #f3f2e6; border: 1px solid #67725b; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; padding: 9px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><p style=\"color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\" data-no-dark=\"\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><p style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #67725b; color: #334331; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section>",
